Optional:
- `async_reference` (Boolean) Allow documents to be indexed successfully even when the referenced document doesn't exist yet.
Only meaningful when `reference` is set.
...
- `reference` (String) Name of a field in another collection that should be linked to this collection so that it can be joined during query (e.g. "users.id").

